<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks fell, five rose and four were flat in 21.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,645.6 points, 0.3 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.3 percent in a 13.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
